      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "MISS GLAMOURPUSS (3) has a strong record this trip with 12 wins and nine placings from 24 starts. Scored by 1.75 lengths last time (22.51) in a NG over 400m at this track. Looks well placed and should feature. FLASH JET (8) was quickly into stride and burnt early from out wide where he gave a sight, finishing third (19.14) and beaten 1.3 lengths over 340m at this track. Didn't win last time but still ran one of the quickest times on the card. Expecting another good run. BLACK MYTH WAVE (2) rocketed around 400m at this track in 22.36 three back then has been in the money the last two since. Expected to feature on best figures. CREEPING TIGER (1) was out of placings last time (23.01) at this track in a NG, finishing sixth and beaten 7 lengths. Has four wins already from this draw.",
